      {
        "id": "colors",
        "title": "Colors",
        "note": "A color follows its noun with the ezafe, like any other adjective: ماشینِ قرمز (māshīn-e ghermez, \"red car\") — see Ezafe - Word Glue. Several colors — نارنجی، صورتی، طلایی، نقره‌ای، خاکستری، فیروزه‌ای — are themselves nouns (orange the fruit, silver the metal, turquoise the stone, ...) with the ی suffix that turns a noun into \"of/like [that thing]\", the same pattern نارنج (nāranj, bitter orange) → نارنجی follows. A shade takes the ezafe too: آبیِ تیره (ābī-ye tīre, dark blue).",
        "terms": [
